    "text": "By Zelda Nguyen ,\n1 days ago For more than half a century, the Goldman family amassed one of New York City’s largest privately held real estate portfolios. At various points, the empire built by the late investor Sol Goldman included interests in the Chrysler Building, the St. Regis Hotel, Olympic Tower and hundreds of commercial and residential properties across Manhattan. Read full article\n4",
